  "question": {
    "text": "For the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> distance between the foci is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;units. From the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> perpendicular tangents are drawn to the hyperbola, then the value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
