  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math> be the eccentricity of the hyperbola<br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math><br />Also <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on the director circle&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn></math>",
